{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdVnB2kyLhhGVumTq4iFW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll help you get Interceptor reconnected. When you reinstalled Chrome, you likely lost the Interceptor extension. Let me get some diagnostics first:\n\n1. **Do you see the Interceptor extension in Chrome's extensions page** (`chrome://extensions/`)?\n2. **Are there any error messages** when you try `interceptor open`, or does it just hang silently?\n3. **Do you remember if you had Interceptor set up with Claude Code before?**\n\nIn the meantime, here's the most likely fix:\n\n**Quick fix — reinstall Interceptor:**\n```bash\ninterceptor install\n```\n\nThen restart Chrome fully (close all windows), and try:\n```bash\ninterceptor open\n```\n\n**If that doesn't work,** we may need to:\n- Clear the old pairing (`interceptor forget`)\n- Uninstall and reinstall the extension cleanly\n- Check for port conflicts\n\nCan you run that `interceptor install` and let me know if it helps, or if you get any error messages? That'll tell us what's going on."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7046,"cache_read_input_tokens":17536,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7046},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"REDACTED","uuid":"4101951b-15cb-44a5-9f8d-46a18bd7698b","timestamp":"2026-07-29T05:15:38.459Z","request_id":"req_011CdVnB1fzBjrFjpyoNQMbn"}
